00:33:39.250 --> 00:33:41.090
And that doesn't work.

00:33:41.680 --> 00:33:43.000
It doesn't work in mental health.

00:33:43.030 --> 00:33:43.670
It may.

00:33:44.390 --> 00:33:47.040
It's not that it never works,
